data: {"type":"agent_complete","agent":"run_analyst_agent","result":"| Ticker | Rating | Analysts | Avg Target | Range | Upside % |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| NVDA | Buy — consensusScore 1.28 (structured feed) | 69 (structured feed) | N/A | N/A | N/A |\n\n**NVDA analyst summary:** Wall Street is broadly positive on NVDA: the rating distribution is **24 Strong Buy / 41 Buy / 3 Hold / 1 Sell / 0 Strong Sell** (structured feed), which maps to a **Buy** consensus despite being very close to a crowded-bullish setup. The **consensus price target is N/A** and **precomputed upside is N/A** because the price-target feed is unavailable, so the bullishness here is based on ratings breadth rather than target-implied return. Three-month price-target trend, recent upgrades/downgrades, and EPS estimate revision trend are **Unavailable**, so **Wall Street Sentiment: Bullish — but trust it only cautiously** given the very heavy Buy skew and missing target/revision context.","models":["openai"]}

